    <TABLE>
      <DESCRIPTION>                                                                              

oid 
___ Unique object identifier
ra (deg) 
___ Object Right Ascension
dec (deg) 
___ Object Declination
clon 
___ Right ascention in Sexagesimal format.
clat 
___ Declination in Sexagesimal format.
field 
___ Field identifier
ccdid 
___ CCD identifier (1-16)
qid 
___ Quadrant (1-4)
filtercode 
___ Filter code (zg, zr, zi)
ngoodobs 
___ Number of epochal detections that were not flagged or masked due to bad pixels
ngoodobsrel 
___ Number of epochal detections in this release not associated with bad pixels
nobs 
___ Total number of epochal detections (observation epochs) in the lightcurve
nobsrel 
___ Total number of epochal detections that are in this release
refmag (mag) 
___ Object magnitude from reference image if detected (not transient)
refmagerr (mag) 
___ Error in refMag
astrometricrms (deg) 
___ Root Mean Squared deviation in epochal positions relative to object RA,Dec
chisq 
___ Chi-square metric using nobs detections
magrms (mag) 
___ Root Mean Squared deviation over nobs magnitudes
maxmag (mag) 
___ Maximum magnitude over nobs detections
medianabsdev (mag) 
___ Median absolute deviation in magnitudes over nobs detections
medianmag (mag) 
___ Median magnitude over nobs detections
medmagerr (mag) 
___ Median of magerr values over nobs detections
minmag (mag) 
___ Minimum magnitude over nobs detections
dist (arcsec) 
___ Distance between the target position and each source in arcsec.
angle (deg) 
___ Position Angle in degree.
</DESCRIPTION>
